    "sections": {
        "description": "The Commercial Cleaning Theme is designed with a structured layout suitable for showcasing cleaning-related services and company information. It includes sections for service listings, team details, pricing tables, testimonials, and contact information. The theme supports responsive design, allowing pages to adjust across desktops, tablets, and mobile devices. Built-in customization options help manage colors, typography, banners, and homepage sections without extensive coding changes. The theme is compatible with common page builder plugins and supports image galleries for displaying completed projects or service highlights. It also includes blog layouts for publishing updates, maintenance tips, or company announcements. Navigation menus, call-to-action buttons, and inquiry forms are arranged to improve accessibility and user interaction. Additional features include social media integration, SEO-friendly code structure, translation readiness, and optimized page layouts for faster loading performance. The design focuses on clean spacing and readable typography suitable for presenting janitorial services, maintenance solutions, and cleaning-related content in an organized format."
    },
